F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:39:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:40:clear all
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:41:set more off
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:42:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:43:* ---- Path bootstrap ----
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:44:if "$ROOT" == "" global ROOT "F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:45:do "$ROOT/code/shared/paths.do"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:46:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:47:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:48:* SETTINGS (reconstructed -- see PROVENANCE above)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:49:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:50:* csvdir holds the third-party HLINK output this script imports; mldir is where
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:51:* the links we derive from it are written. They used to be the same folder.
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:52:local csvdir   "$D_LINKS_RAW"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:53:local mldir    "$D_LINKS"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:54:local intdir   "$D_LINKS/intermediate"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:55:local sfx      ""
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:56:local reimport 1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:57:local testrun  0
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:58:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:59:capture mkdir "`intdir'"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:60:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:61:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:62:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:63:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:64:* PROGRAM: import one CSV, filter, rename, save
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:65:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:66:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:67:capture program drop import_step
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:68:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:69:program define import_step
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:70:    syntax, csvfile(string) outfile(string) [maxrows(integer 0)]
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:71:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:72:    * rowrange() counts the header as row 1, so ask for maxrows+1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:73:    if `maxrows' > 0 {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:74:        local lastrow = `maxrows' + 1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:75:        local rowopt "rowrange(1:`lastrow')"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:76:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:77:    else {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:78:        local rowopt ""
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:79:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:80:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:81:    di as txt _newline "  importing `csvfile' ..."
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:82:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:83:    * colrange(1:4) skips probability_array, which is by far the
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:84:    * widest column and is not needed downstream
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:85:    import delimited using "`csvfile'", ///
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:86:        varnames(1) colrange(1:4) stringcols(1 2) bindquote(strict) ///
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:87:        `rowopt' clear
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:88:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:89:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:90:    di as txt "    rows read:               " as res %15.0fc r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:91:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:92:    * prediction arrives numeric or string depending on how the
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:93:    * quoting is parsed — handle either
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:94:    capture confirm string variable prediction
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:95:    if _rc == 0 {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:96:        quietly keep if prediction == "1"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:97:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:98:    else {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:99:        quietly keep if prediction == 1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:100:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:101:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:102:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:103:    di as txt "    rows with prediction==1: " as res %15.0fc r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:104:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:105:    rename histid_a histid1930
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:106:    rename histid_b histid1940
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:107:    keep  histid1930 histid1940 probability
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:108:    order histid1930 histid1940 probability
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:109:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:110:    label variable histid1930  "1930 census HISTID (histid_a)"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:111:    label variable histid1940  "1940 census HISTID (histid_b)"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:112:    label variable probability "Model match probability"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:113:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:114:    save "`outfile'", replace
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:115:    di as txt "    saved: `outfile'"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:116:end
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:117:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:118:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:119:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:120:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:121:* MAIN LOOP: before, after
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:122:* ============================================================
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:123:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:124:foreach when in before after {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:125:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:126:    di as txt _newline(2) "============================================================"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:127:    di as txt "VINTAGE: `when'"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:128:    di as txt "============================================================"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:129:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:130:    local f_s1   "`intdir'\step1_`when'_clean`sfx'.dta"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:131:    local f_s2   "`intdir'\step2_`when'_clean`sfx'.dta"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:132:    local f_id30 "`intdir'\step2_`when'_ids1930`sfx'.dta"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:133:    local f_id40 "`intdir'\step2_`when'_ids1940`sfx'.dta"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:134:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:135:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:136:    * Import both steps
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:137:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:138:    if `reimport' {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:139:        di as txt _newline "-- STEP 2 --"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:140:        import_step, csvfile("`csvdir'\step2_matches_`when'.csv") ///
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:141:                     outfile("`f_s2'") maxrows(`testrun')
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:142:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:143:        di as txt _newline "-- STEP 1 --"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:144:        import_step, csvfile("`csvdir'\step1_matches_`when'.csv") ///
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:145:                     outfile("`f_s1'") maxrows(`testrun')
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:146:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:147:    else {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:148:        di as txt _newline "reimport == 0: reusing existing intermediate files"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:149:    }
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:150:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:151:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:152:    * Records step 2 already linked, on BOTH sides
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:153:    *
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:154:    * Two kinds of cross-step conflict have to be caught:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:155:    *   (a) one 1930 record linked to different 1940 records by
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:156:    *       step 1 and step 2  -> collide on histid1930
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:157:    *   (b) two different 1930 records linked to the same 1940
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:158:    *       record by step 1 and step 2 -> collide on histid1940
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:159:    * Step 2 wins in both, so a step 1 pair survives only if
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:160:    * NEITHER of its records appears anywhere in step 2.
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:161:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:162:    quietly describe using "`f_s2'"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:163:    local n_s2 = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:164:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:165:    * "use varlist using" reads a single column off disk rather
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:166:    * than loading the whole ~5 GB file
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:167:    use histid1930 using "`f_s2'", clear
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:168:    quietly duplicates drop
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:169:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:170:    local n_s2_id30 = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:171:    save "`f_id30'", replace
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:172:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:173:    use histid1940 using "`f_s2'", clear
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:174:    quietly duplicates drop
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:175:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:176:    local n_s2_id40 = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:177:    save "`f_id40'", replace
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:178:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:179:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:180:    * Step 1: drop pairs that collide with step 2 on either side
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:181:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:182:    use "`f_s1'", clear
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:183:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:184:    local n_s1 = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:185:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:186:    merge m:1 histid1930 using "`f_id30'", keep(master) nogenerate
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:187:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:188:    local n_s1_mid = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:189:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:190:    merge m:1 histid1940 using "`f_id40'", keep(master) nogenerate
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:191:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:192:    local n_s1_kept = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:193:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:194:    local n_drop30  = `n_s1' - `n_s1_mid'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:195:    local n_drop40  = `n_s1_mid' - `n_s1_kept'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:196:    local n_s1_drop = `n_s1' - `n_s1_kept'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:197:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:198:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:199:    * Combine and save
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:200:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:201:    append using "`f_s2'"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:202:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:203:    sort histid1930 histid1940
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:204:    quietly count
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:205:    local n_total = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:206:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:207:    quietly by histid1930: generate byte first30 = (_n == 1)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:208:    quietly count if first30 == 1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:209:    local n_persons = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:210:    drop first30
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:211:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:212:    label data "1930-1940 links, `when' transcription; step2 supersedes step1"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:213:    save "`mldir'\matches_`when'`sfx'.dta", replace
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:214:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:215:    * Distinct 1940 records. Costs a second sort, but it is the
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:216:    * check that the many-to-one case was actually handled: any
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:217:    * gap between this and the pair count now comes from within
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:218:    * step 1 or within step 2, never from a cross-step collision.
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:219:    sort histid1940
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:220:    quietly by histid1940: generate byte first40 = (_n == 1)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:221:    quietly count if first40 == 1
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:222:    local n_rec1940 = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:223:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:224:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:225:    * Report
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:226:    * --------------------------------------------------------
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:227:    di as txt _newline "----- `when': summary -----"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:228:    di as txt "step 2 pairs (all kept):         " as res %15.0fc `n_s2'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:229:    di as txt "  distinct histid1930 in step 2: " as res %15.0fc `n_s2_id30'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:230:    di as txt "  distinct histid1940 in step 2: " as res %15.0fc `n_s2_id40'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:231:    di as txt "step 1 pairs read:               " as res %15.0fc `n_s1'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:232:    di as txt "  dropped, 1930 side in step 2:  " as res %15.0fc `n_drop30'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:233:    di as txt "  dropped, 1940 side in step 2:  " as res %15.0fc `n_drop40'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:234:    di as txt "  superseded in total:           " as res %15.0fc `n_s1_drop'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:235:    di as txt "  retained:                      " as res %15.0fc `n_s1_kept'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:236:    di as txt "combined pairs:                  " as res %15.0fc `n_total'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:237:    di as txt "  distinct histid1930:           " as res %15.0fc `n_persons'
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/02_hlink/build_matched_links.do:238:    di as txt "  distinct histid1940:           " as res %15.0fc `n_rec1940'
