F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:6:* and overwrites $OUT_TABLES/linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:7:*
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:8:* Runs standalone: the bootstrap below defines every path it
