F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:81:* band e = exact, band c = conservative
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:82:*****************************************
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:83:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:84:foreach band in e c {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:85:
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:86:	if "`band'" == "e" {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:87:		local o "oldnames"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:88:		local n "newnames"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:89:	}
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/03_mortality/05_make_linkage_table.do:90:	else {
