F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:39:\textit{Notes:} Links are ABE exact matches between the 1940 Census and BUNMD v2
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:40:on cleaned first name, cleaned last name, and harmonized birthplace, requiring
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:41:uniqueness within a $\pm$2-year birth-year window in both files. The conservative
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:42:variant additionally drops records with any competing potential match within
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:43:$\pm$2 years of birth. Old names and new names refer to the two cleaned name
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:44:variables carried through the pipeline (\texttt{f\_name\_old\_cleaned} and
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:45:\texttt{l\_name\_old\_cleaned} versus their \texttt{\_new\_} counterparts).
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:46:Linkage rates use a denominator of 20,886,324 BUNMD men with birth year
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:47:$\leq$ 1940. The validation sample is the subset of links with a middle initial
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:48:observed in both sources; initials agree is the share of that subset whose
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:49:initials match. Middle initials are not used as a matching criterion, so this
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:50:serves as an out-of-sample check on match quality. Difference and \% change
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:51:columns compare new names to old names; for rows measured in percent, the
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/output/tables\linkage_table_mortality_bunmd.tex:52:difference is in percentage points.
