F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall_step3.do:63:* both sides blank on the same field -- the join could only have been blank-on-blank
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall_step3.do:64:quietly count if trim(f_name_A) == "" & trim(f_name_B) == ""
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall_step3.do:65:local bf = r(N)
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall_step3.do:66:quietly count if trim(l_name_A) == "" & trim(l_name_B) == ""
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall_step3.do:67:local bl = r(N)
