F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:37:    local tag    "ans_cleaned"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:38:}
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:39:else {
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:40:    local bpldir "$ABEJW/data/by_bpl_new_transcription"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:41:    local tag    "true_cleaned"
F:/Deaglan/Census_Transcriptions/code/01_abe_jw/linkage/diagnose_abe_shortfall.do:42:}
