\title{Improving Historical Census Transcriptions: A Machine Learning Approach\thanks{\protect\footnotesize This research was undertaken thanks to funding from the Canada Excellence Research Chairs program awarded to Dr. Erik Snowberg in Data-Intensive Methods in Economics. We thank the participants of the Canadian Economic History Network sessions at the 2024 Canadian Economic Association Conference for their helpful comments. Correspondence can be addressed to \href{mailto:ilmyounghwang@gmail.com}{\nolinkurl{ilmyounghwang@gmail.com.}}}}



