  "summary": "The saved logs support successful generation of all five tables, but HLINK’s reported match rates include links outside the denominator population. Fix that sample mismatch first: the logs establish discrepancies that change all four displayed HLINK rates. Sample captions, validation claims, and upstream replication gaps also need correction before these tables enter the paper.",
