      "what_the_code_does": "The script separately selects each vintage’s links with nonblank initials and computes `lower(mi) == lower(mname_B)`. It neither isolates newly added pairs nor evaluates them against independent truth. Nevertheless, documentation concludes that 'the extra links are more accurate, not less'. Both the linked population and the census initial field change between vintages.",
